<blockquote class="uncited"><div><blockquote class="uncited"><div>Can you clean away the voice prompts from the radio?<br><br>I installed them just to test how they sounded.<br><br>Now I have to disable them every time the options are reset</div></blockquote>There isn't a feature to remove voice prompts, but you could reload the DMR ID database and choose the option to use the Voice Prompts memory as additional storage for DMR IDs. This would have the same effect</div></blockquote>I will try that.<br><br>BTW,  noticed that you can select Radio below the option "Use Voice Prompt memory" in the CPS "Download Callsign database"<br>I couldn't find RT3S/MD-UV380 in that list.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2867">SA0BUX</a> — Sat Jan 07, 2023 10:47 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
